NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001269 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001270 "=head1 CONTRIBUTING"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001271 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001272 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001273 "To contribute, you can send patches by email/via RT, or send pull requests on"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001274 "GitHub."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001275 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001276 "Most of the time, you don't need to build the distribution yourself. You can"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001277 "simply modify the code, then test via:"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001278 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001279 " % prove -l"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001280 ""
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001281 "If you want to build the distribution (e.g. to try to install it locally on your"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001282 "system), you can install L<Dist::Zilla>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001283 "L<Dist::Zilla::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>,"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001284 "L<Pod::Weaver::PluginBundle::Author::PERLANCAR>, and sometimes one or two other"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001285 "Dist::Zilla- and/or Pod::Weaver plugins. Any additional steps required beyond"
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001286 "that are considered a bug and can be reported to me."
NSQ_SOURCE_LINE 00001287 ""
